        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Doug Liman, Saul Metzstein, Chris Richmond\n- Roles: film directors, producer\n- Works: Swingers, Go, The Bourne Identity, Mr. & Mrs. Smith, Jumper, Fair Game, Edge of Tomorrow\n\nFacts:\n- Doug Liman was born on July 24, 1965, and he is an American film director and producer.\n- Saul Metzstein was born on December 30, 1970, and he is a Scottish film director.\n- Doug Liman is best known for the films \"Swingers\" (1996), \"Go\" (1999), \"The Bourne Identity\" (2002), \"Mr. & Mrs. Smith\" (2005), \"Jumper\" (2008), \"Fair Game\" (2010), and \"Edge of Tomorrow\" (2014).\n- During his career, Chris Richmond worked with notable directors including Pete Travis, Simon Cellan Jones, Jez Butterworth, Saul Metzstein, Carol Morley, and Matt Hope.",
